swift-tr46
Copyright (c) 2026 GeoSpoof contributors

swift-tr46 is a Swift port of tr46 (https://github.com/jsdom/tr46), jsdom's
implementation of Unicode IDNA Compatibility Processing (UTS #46), and of the
Punycode implementation in punycode.js
(https://github.com/mathiasbynens/punycode.js). Both are MIT licensed. LICENSE
covers the port and carries the copyright notices of both projects.

Unicode data

This package contains data derived from Unicode data files:

- Sources/TR46/Generated/NFCTables.swift, the normalization tables, is
  generated from the Unicode 18.0.0 Character Database: UnicodeData.txt,
  CompositionExclusions.txt and DerivedNormalizationProps.txt.
- Sources/TR46/Generated/IDNATables.swift, the mapping and validity tables,
  re-encodes tr46 7.0.0's lib/mappingTable.json and lib/regexes.js, which tr46
  generates from Unicode 18.0.0 data files.
- Tests/TR46Tests/Resources/normalization-test.json and idna-test-v2.json, the
  conformance test data, are derived from Unicode's NormalizationTest.txt,
  IdnaTestV2.txt and DerivedAge.txt. The idnaTestV2 inputs of
  geospoof-idna-vectors.json and the IdnaTestV2 inputs of differential.json
  come from IdnaTestV2.txt.

Those files are distributed under the Unicode License V3, reproduced at the
end of this file.

web-platform-tests data

Tests/TR46Tests/Resources/wpt-toascii.json, and the WPT inputs of
differential.json, are derived from web-platform-tests'
url/resources/toascii.json and url/resources/IdnaTestV2.json at commit
13748c36fdf9dd77cd0b34dd6b244256b365ea60, the commit tr46 7.0.0's tests use.
Copyright © web-platform-tests contributors, under the 3-Clause BSD License.
The full text, copied from that commit's LICENSE.md, is in
Tests/TR46Tests/Resources/LICENSE-web-platform-tests.md.

GeoSpoof test fixture

Tests/TR46Tests/Resources/geospoof-idna-vectors.json is copied unchanged from
the GeoSpoof iOS app repository (tests/fixtures/idna-vectors.json at commit
5e655ee5be0a309f3c28515ecfe6587fb96cd17c). It records what the GeoSpoof
browser extension's hostToASCII, which calls tr46 7.0.0, returned for 3,769
inputs. It is contributed by the GeoSpoof contributors under this package's
LICENSE, apart from its IdnaTestV2.txt inputs, which fall under the Unicode
License V3 as above.

